{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e246d6006945d2801fd5","chatId":"f737474c30fd4ab488d43ae63ddc6252","sessionId":null,"userId":58759,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"[[A]]","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"[[A]]","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":848,"promptTokens":1575,"completionTokens":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:34:30"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.003172682701105199,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e246d6006945d2801fd1","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368070114,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:34:30","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e246d6006945d2801fd1","chatId":"f737474c30fd4ab488d43ae63ddc6252","sessionId":null,"userId":58759,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"下面给你提供一段故事，一个问题和若干答案选项，请你根据故事内容和给定的问题，按照常理推测，选择一个最可能的答案选项，并输出答案序号。\n注意：\n（1）请只输出最可能的答案序号，格式为：[[答案序号]]，例如，最可能的答案选项为“A. 手提包”，则输出“[[A]]”；\n（2）请必须从给定的答案选项“A、B、C、D”中选择一个做为最可能的答案作为输出，无论故事中是否提供足够的信息，如果你认为故事里没有足够的信息选出答案，请随机输出“[[A]]”，“[[B]]”，“[[C]]”，“[[D]]”其中之一；\n（3）请只输出在给定的信息下最可能的答案序号，不要输出其他内容。\n\n[故事]\n一天下午，公司内的紧张气氛似乎比平时更浓。雪梅在一旁观察着军波处理一位非常挑剔的客户。她假装专注于自己的工作，但实际上她时刻关注着军波和客户之间的互动。军波在努力保持专业态度，但面对客户的连番质疑，他显得有些不知所措。此时，志强，一位经验丰富的销售员，虽未直接介入，却隐约表现出对情况的关注。雪梅轻轻地走到旁边的复印机，似乎在处理文件，但她的眼神不时瞥向军波。突然，她快速地写下几行字，小心翼翼地将一张纸条放在了军波的笔记本上。军波只是匆匆瞥了一眼纸条，随后继续处理客户的问题。志强在去往军波工位的途中目睹了这一幕，脸上掠过一丝微笑，然后又回到了自己的工位上。\n\n[问题]\n雪梅为什么要给军波留那张纸条？\n\n[答案选项]\nA. 雪梅是一个热心的人。\nB. 雪梅想让军波暂时离开。\nC. 雪梅无意中留下了那张纸条。\nD. 雪梅试图分散客户的注意力。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.003172682701105199,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e246d6006945d2801fd5","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368070112,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:34:30","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"f616736cdbb147e393f745116ef470af"}